WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.468 --> 00:00:02.569 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Let´s just jump right into
the awkwardness

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:04.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
of writing a book
about your life.

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was that a hurdle
for you to get over

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
to open up and tell
all these stories to people?

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:12.112
-I´ve been able to hide
behind characters for my career,

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:14.214
which has been such a luxury.

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:16.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I thought,
"Well, you know what?

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:19.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, maybe I have
something to say," you know?

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:22.155
And I could tell people about
how lonely I was growing up

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:25.992 size:84% position:42%
or how insecure I felt
or jealous or whatever.

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:28.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so I thought,
"I´m gonna write a book."

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:29.729 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Sighs ]

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:30.930 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.332 size:75% position:38%
-How quickly into it

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:34.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
did you feel that deep sigh
that you just gave us?

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:36.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Chuckles ] Pretty quickly.
-Yeah.

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:40.173 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And now that it´s coming out,
I´m really proud of it,

00:00:40.173 --> 00:00:42.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I hope that --
I don´t know.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:46.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
The idea of,
like, a collective experience,

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:49.282 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, the insecurities
that we all face.

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:50.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah,
I think a lot of people --

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.451
-What are your insecurities?

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:52.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What are my insecurities?
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:55.121
-I certainly -- growing up,
I had nothing but insecurities.

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:56.923 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I felt very --
-Like what?

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:58.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What? Like what?
-Yeah.

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:01.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like, I didn´t -- I could--
I had stage fright.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.962
I didn´t get onstage until --

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:05.165
I´d never wanted to do school
plays or anything like that

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:07.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
until I was, like,
late in high school.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.469
-I was known as the short kid.

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:10.870
Like, that was my identity.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:14.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I think that everyone has,
like,

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:17.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
that sort of the adjective
that described them.

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, what was yours?

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:20.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, what was the adjective
that described me?

00:01:20.814 --> 00:01:23.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Like...
-It´s not an adjective,

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:25.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I think "Braces"
would have been a very good...

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:26.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-I was "Headgear."

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.154 size:78% position:39%
-You were "Headgear"?
-I totally trump you.

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:30.223 size:88% position:44%
-Yeah. Did you actually
wear headgear to school?

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:31.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-No!

00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:32.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, God,
it was the worst mistake.

00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:35.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How bad were your teeth?
-Lacy was going to --

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:37.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
She was like,
"You´re headgear girl.

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:38.731
I´m gonna kick your ass."

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, Lacy was very bad
at nicknames.

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:42.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.303
"Oh, you have a headgear.

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:44.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know
what we´re gonna call you?

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:46.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
´Headgear Girl.´"
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:48.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, God.
Now I´m shaking.

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.543
-Yeah, I remember once going --

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:52.645 size:84% position:42%
I had so much anxiety
about going to parties.

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:55.248
And I think the first time
I got invited to a party,

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:57.117 size:78% position:39%
I was asking my dad,
"What should I wear?"

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he helped me pick out
an outfit,

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:00.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then I went,
and I realized that

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:02.188
I was dressed the way my dad
would be dressed at a party.

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:03.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Like what?

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:05.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like, everybody else
was in jeans and T-shirts,

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:08.261
and I was, like, with a sweater
tucked into khakis.

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:09.662 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]
-Ohh. I love that.

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:12.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
-With the belted khakis and...
-And you got laid, right?

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:14.300 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did not.
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.401
Although it would have been

00:02:15.401 --> 00:02:17.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
a very inappropriate age
to get laid.

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:19.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
So thank God.

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:20.974
Thank God I dodged that bullet.

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:22.942
And you -- this was sort of --

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:25.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, you had a platform
of doing this podcast.

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:27.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
So your podcast "Unqualified,"
as well,

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:31.351 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you take --
you give people advice.

00:02:31.351 --> 00:02:33.953
-Which is...unbelievably absurd

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:36.523 size:84% position:42%
because I have no idea
what I´m talking about.

00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:37.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
But...

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:40.126
-And you´ve let people know that
by the title of your podcast.

00:02:40.126 --> 00:02:41.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
You´re not claiming
to be an expert.

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:42.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I try to --
I try to reinforce it.

00:02:42.629 --> 00:02:44.063 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Over and over.

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:46.633
-And what sort of issues
do people want your advice with?

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:50.036
-Well, they, you know, people --
we talk to --

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:51.271 size:78% position:39%
I started the podcast

00:02:51.271 --> 00:02:54.474
because I wanted to kind of talk
to strangers.

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:58.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-Without the format of --

00:02:58.144 --> 00:03:01.247 align:start size:94% position:6%
of Hollywood or fame.
-Sure.

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:02.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Or, you know...
-Yeah.

00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:05.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...just as creepy people do.
-[ Laughs ] Yeah.

00:03:05.585 --> 00:03:11.024
-But, so people -- so we --
we talked to people about --

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:13.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
our most common themes
tend to be,

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:15.662
"Why doesn´t he or she like me?"
-Okay.

00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:20.400
-But we´ve now -- we´ve had
some pretty interesting callers.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:24.037
Recently, we had a woman who had
a threesome with her fiancé...

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:25.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh. Uh-huh.

00:03:25.605 --> 00:03:28.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...and a woman
that they met on Facebook.

00:03:28.575 --> 00:03:32.212
And the woman called up a month
later and said she was pregnant.

00:03:32.212 --> 00:03:34.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The -- The extra woman.
The third woman?

00:03:34.948 --> 00:03:36.549 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The third woman.
-Oh, God.

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:37.817
They did -- Oh, it was you?

00:03:37.817 --> 00:03:40.019 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:42.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
-40! Still got it!

00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:44.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.357 --> 00:03:46.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow. That -- What kind
of advice do you give there?

00:03:46.926 --> 00:03:49.262
-Oh, I was
[Chuckling] totally speechless.

00:03:49.262 --> 00:03:51.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I mean, what do you say?

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:54.100 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, you know,
I think I was just asking her,

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.736
