"Are you and your fiancé okay?"

00:03:56.736 --> 00:03:58.771 size:75% position:38%
Because, in my book,

00:03:58.771 --> 00:04:02.141
I talk about things that
sound better than they are.

00:04:02.141 --> 00:04:03.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:04.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And one of them
is having a threesome.

00:04:04.677 --> 00:04:06.746 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:07.981
-Have you had a threesome?

00:04:07.981 --> 00:04:09.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I´ve never had a threesome.
-Ohh.

00:04:09.749 --> 00:04:11.818 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I almost did,
but they said, "Khakis?"

00:04:11.818 --> 00:04:13.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:13.753 --> 00:04:14.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
That close.

00:04:14.988 --> 00:04:16.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
Khakis were the deal-breaker.
[ Applause ]

